      "writtenOn": "2019-11-14T04:41:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As described in go/rvc-ota-persist-logs, the goal is to persist the log across reboot on pixel 3+. And the location in sys file is qualcom chip specific.\n\nMore background:\nThe soc on pixel 3+ always do hard reset. Qualcom\u0027s chip doesn\u0027t support warm reset. So our bootloader simulate the process by\nbacking up -\u003e hard reset -\u003e restore\n\n\nI talked to a few kernel people and this will not be in the generic kernel, since this is qualcom specific. \n\nI then realize the default implementation won\u0027t work on CF. Maybe I should not use a HAL at all, and an system property is sufficient?",
